#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-neo-3x.rst:7
#: 190a21b818944d7ba247079e8a57af7c
msgid "NEO 3X is a GNSS receiver with IP66 protection level. It supports four-star system integration and has a variety of built-in waterproof and dust-proof structural designs and materials to meet dust-proof and waterproof requirements in various environments. It has built-in STM32F4 series processor, ICP2100 barometer, Ublox M9N module and RM3100 industrial grade compass, and supports DroneCan protocol."
msgstr ""

